    <glossary>
    <definition id="def-00001"><term>de-idealization</term><meaning>tendency of adolescents to see a mismatch between the values their parents proclaim, the rules they put forward, and the way imperfect parents lead their own imperfect lives</meaning></definition>
    </glossary>    
